    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "16.【详解】（1）由 $f(x) = \\ln (a - x) \\Rightarrow f'(x) = \\frac{1}{x - a}$ ， $y = xf(x) \\Rightarrow y' = \\ln (a - x) + \\frac{x}{x - a}$ ，",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            70,
            766,
            101
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "又 x=0 是函数 $y=xf(x)$ 的极值点，所以 $y'(0)=\\ln a=0$ ，解得 a=1。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            112,
            618,
            129
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "经检验，a=1时满足题意.",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            146,
            297,
            161
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "（2）由（I）知， $g(x)=\\frac{x+\\ln(1-x)}{x\\ln(1-x)}=\\frac{1}{\\ln(1-x)}+\\frac{1}{x}$ ，其定义域为 $(-∞,0)U(0,1)$ .",
        "bbox": [
            95,
            168,
            697,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "要证 $g(x) < 1$ ，即证 $\\frac{1}{\\ln(1 - x)} + \\frac{1}{x} < 1$ ，即证 $\\frac{1}{\\ln(1 - x)} < 1 - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{x - 1}{x}$ .",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            206,
            591,
            239
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(i) 当 $x \\in (0,1)$ 时， $\\frac{1}{\\ln(1-x)} < 0$ ， $\\frac{x-1}{x} < 0$ ，即证 $\\ln(1-x) > \\frac{x}{x-1}$ 。令 $F(x) = \\ln(1-x) - \\frac{x}{x-1}$ ，因为",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            244,
            850,
            277
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$F^{\\prime}(x) = \\frac{-1}{1 - x} -\\frac{-1}{(x - 1)^{2}} = \\frac{x}{(x - 1)^{2}} >0$ ，所以 $F(x)$ 在区间(0,1)内为增函数，所以 $F(x) > F(0) = 0$",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            282,
            813,
            313
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "（ii）当 $x \\in (-\\infty, 0)$ 时， $\\frac{1}{\\ln(1 - x)} > 0$ ， $\\frac{x - 1}{x} > 0$ ，即证 $\\ln(1 - x) > \\frac{x}{x - 1}$ ，由（i）分析知 $F(x)$ 在区间 $(- \\infty, 0)$ 内为减函数，所以 $F(x) > F(0) = 0$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            318,
            905,
            375
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "综合（i）（ii）有 $g(x) < 1$",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            387,
            290,
            403
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "补充题答案: 解(1)记“第 $i$ 次投篮的人是甲”为事件 $A_{i}$ , “第 $i$ 次投篮的人是乙”为事件 $B_{i}$ , 则",
        "bbox": [
            89,
            414,
            789,
            431
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nP (B _ {2}) = P \\left(A _ {1} B _ {2}\\right) + P \\left(B _ {1} B _ {2}\\right) = P \\left(A _ {1}\\right) \\cdot P \\left(B _ {2} \\mid A _ {1}\\right) + P \\left(B _ {1}\\right) P \\left(B _ {2} \\mid B _ {1}\\right) = 0. 5 \\times (1 - 0. 6) + 0. 5 \\times 0. 8 = 0. 6.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            443,
            784,
            458
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 设 $P(A_{i})=p_{i}$ ，依题可知， $P(B_{i})=1-p_{i}$",
        "bbox": [
            100,
            470,
            410,
            487
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则当 $i \\geqslant 2$ 时, $P(A_{i}) = P(A_{i-1}A_{i}) + P(B_{i-1}A_{i}) = P(A_{i-1}) \\cdot P(A_{i}|A_{i-1}) + P(B_{i-1})P(A_{i}|B_{i-1})$ ,",
        "bbox": [
            89,
            498,
            702,
            514
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\np _ {i} = 0. 6 p _ {i - 1} + (1 - 0. 8) \\times (1 - p _ {i - 1}) = 0. 4 p _ {i - 1} + 0. 2 = \\frac {2}{5} p _ {i - 1} + \\frac {1}{5}.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            107,
            526,
            509,
            552
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "构造等比数列 $\\{p_{i}+\\lambda\\}$ ,",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            563,
            262,
            579
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $p_i + \\lambda = \\frac{2}{5} (p_{i - 1} + \\lambda)$ ，解得 $\\lambda = -\\frac{1}{3}$ 则 $p_i - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{5}\\left(p_{i - 1} - \\frac{1}{3}\\right).$",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            590,
            482,
            618
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "又 $p_1 = \\frac{1}{2}, p_1 - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{1}{6}$ ,",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            627,
            233,
            653
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所以 $\\left\\{p_{i} - \\frac{1}{3}\\right\\}$ 是首项为 $\\frac{1}{6}$ , 公比为 $\\frac{2}{5}$ 的等比数列,",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            663,
            423,
            692
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\np _ {i - \\frac {1}{3}} = \\frac {1}{6} \\times \\left(\\frac {2}{5}\\right) ^ {i - 1}, p _ {i} = \\frac {1}{6} \\times \\left(\\frac {2}{5}\\right) ^ {i - 1} + \\frac {1}{3}, i \\in \\mathbf {N} _ {+}.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            110,
            700,
            448,
            731
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)因为 $p_{i}=\\frac{1}{6}\\times\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{i-1}+\\frac{1}{3},i=1,2,\\cdots,n,$",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            737,
            393,
            768
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所以当 $n \\in N_{+}$ 时, $E(Y) = p_{1} + p_{2} + \\cdots + p_{n} = \\frac{1}{6} \\times \\frac{1 - \\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{n}}{1 - \\frac{2}{5}} + \\frac{n}{3} = \\frac{5}{18} \\left[ 1 - \\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{n} \\right] + \\frac{n}{3}$ ,",
        "bbox": [
            89,
            778,
            675,
            818
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $E(Y) = \\frac{5}{18}\\left[1 - \\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^n\\right] + \\frac{n}{3}.$",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            831,
            300,
            860
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
